cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the version-specific software DOI assigned to the GitHub release and the accompanying dataset."
title: "GEOMAPS: sparse-pyramid MVT and MLT compression"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23456861"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/goodlancer-org/mvt-mlt-granularity"
abstract: >-
  Code for "Does Tile Granularity Matter? An Empirical Study of Vector Tile
  Compression for Map Rendering with MapLibre Tiles": vector-source
  normalization, paired Standard/Dense-4/Dense-16 MVT and MLT PMTiles
  conversion, independent decoded-pair diagnostics, compression statistics,
  map figures, and SQLite/Parquet/CSV dataset export.
keywords:
  - vector tiles
  - MapLibre
  - MLT
  - MVT
  - PMTiles
  - compression
  - tile granularity
